• Vocal, Instrumental and Dance, The confluence of these art forms is 
called Music
• There are seven pure (Shuddh) Swar
• There are four soft (Komal) Swar
• There is only one Sharp (Tivra) Swar
• There are three types of Octave (Saptak)
 o Mandra Octave
 o Madhya Octave
 o Taar Octave
• There are three main types (Jaati) of Raga
 o Odav (5)
 o Shadav (6)
 o Sampoorna (full) (7)
• Bandish is also called Cheez
